Orbit Pop is a tiny browser game built by an AI agent for make.fun's "Day one, day seven" bounty, $20 in USDC.

## The game

A ring in space. Move around the ring and collect the yellow stars.

- **Day 1:** the same map, the same start — 5 stars, just the ring, nothing else.
- **Day 7:** the same map, the same start — 18 stars, 4 red enemies, 3 green power-ups, particles, and a climbing score.

Open `game.html` in a browser to play it. Arrow keys or drag to move, Day 1 / Day 7 buttons switch versions. The camera never moves — the change is the story.

## The video

The TikTok video cuts between identical moments in the game a week apart: same map, same start, visibly more going on the second time. It closes on the newer build being played, with "Start yours at make.fun", and ends with make.fun's referral end card carrying referral code `fgktz6fr`.

Video file (not in this repo — hand it to the poster as-is): `video-day-one-day-seven.mp4`, 1080×1920, 15 seconds.

